    "decision": "EXCLUDE",                                                                                              
    "rationale": "While qualitative and involving adolescents (11-17 years), the study focuses on Chronic Fatigue       
Syndrome/Myalgic Encephalomyelitis (CFS/ME), which is primarily characterized by fatigue rather than chronic pain. The  
review specifically targets chronic non-cancer pain conditions. Pain is not the primary focus of this study.",          
    "confidence": "medium"                                                                                              
})                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
# Study 507: Kidney transplant - pain is secondary stressor                                                             
